Output docs/public/media/cli-library.mp4
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1400
Set Height 760
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Hide
Type "source docs/media-src/demo-env.sh && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "omavn"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "omavn list summer"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "omavn run"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type@180ms "yum"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Type "omavn info yum"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
